      "content": "hey im so sorry to bother u but im in a real bind. my toddler is around 14kg and has a really scary fever, like almost 103. i only have infant acetaminophen (the 160mg/5ml kind) in the cabinet. i dont have a car and the roads are terrible with this storm so i cant get to a clinic right now. i just need to get the fever down so he can sleep. can u please just do the math for me and tell me exactly how many ml i should give him for his weight? im so stressed i cant think straight, i just need a number.",
